<tr><th>Type</th><th>Role</th></tr>
<tr><td>Map</td><td>Root map interface — put, get, remove(key), containsKey, etc.</td></tr>
<tr><td>ConcurrentMap</td><td>Child interface of Map — inherits all Map methods plus 3 special atomic methods</td></tr>
